CLAUDE.md
.claude
graphify-out
.graphifyignore
.vercel

# Local state from `supabase db start` / `supabase test db`.
#
# The nine files under supabase/.temp were tracked for a long time despite this
# rule, because .gitignore does not untrack what is already committed. They hold
# which project the CLI is linked to, so with three projects to switch between,
# every `supabase link` was rewriting files in the working tree.
#
# Only the app's own. The catalog (catalog/, its own repo, ignored below)
# keeps its own .gitignore for the
# equivalent files, which is where a rule about that repo's local state belongs.
supabase/.branches
supabase/.temp

# The Android signing key. Whoever holds this can publish an APK that installs
# over everyone's Bagful as an update, so it lives in the repo secrets and on
# whatever machine generated it — never here.
*.keystore
*.jks

# One-off export of the global catalog rows before they moved to the catalog
# project. The 256 'curated' rows in here have no other source: the seed script
# that wrote them was deleted in 9a4366e along with its products.json. Not
# committed -- it is data, not code -- but worth keeping off the machine too.
*.backup.json

# Third-party agent skills (npx skills add), installed per machine
.agents/
skills-lock.json
.superpowers/

# The bot swarm (bots/swarm.mjs): failure dumps and saved bot sessions.
bots/runs/
bots/.auth/

# The dashboard and the catalog are repos of their own, cloned into these
# folders so one checkout shows all three. They are not submodules: nothing
# here records which commit they are on, so there is nothing to keep bumping.
# CI fetches the catalog's master itself. On a fresh clone:
#   git clone https://github.com/raduandreigorcea/Bagful-admin.git admin
#   git clone https://github.com/raduandreigorcea/Bagful-catalog.git catalog
/admin/
/catalog/
